      "releaseNotes": "Ajout de feuilles de score pour Castle Party, Draftosaurus, Everdell Emerland, Forêt mixte: Smoky Mountains, Fountains, Goa, Lodge, Opera Magna, Planted: A Game of Nature &amp; Nurture, The Trial of the Forest, La Vallée des Tori.",
